{"no":19,"stage":3,"part":"A","title_en":"The past verb: I, you, we, they","title_ar":"الْفِعْلُ الْمَاضِي: كُلُّ الضَّمَائِرِ","q_en":"Who did it, when there is no doer word? The ending tells you.","q_ar":"مَنْ فَعَلَ؟ آخِرُ الْفِعْلِ يَدُلُّ عَلَيْهِ.","not_yet":["Verbs for TWO people (dual): just know they exist.","What the verb is done to (an object): next lesson.","The present tense (he writes): Lesson 21."],"not_yet_ar":["أَفْعَالُ الِاثْنَيْنِ (الْمُثَنَّى): اعْرِفْ فَقَطْ أَنَّهَا مَوْجُودَةٌ.","مَا وَقَعَ عَلَيْهِ الْفِعْلُ: الدَّرْسُ التَّالِي.","الْفِعْلُ الْمُضَارِعُ (يَكْتُبُ): الدَّرْسُ الْحَادِي وَالْعِشْرُونَ."],"slides":[{"t":"look","head_en":"Look: I, you (m), you (f)","head_ar":"اُنْظُرْ: أَنَا، أَنْتَ، أَنْتِ","mode":"kind","sents":[["ذَهَبْتُ إِلَى الْمَدْرَسَةِ.","vpn","I went to the school."],["ذَهَبْتَ إِلَى الْمَدْرَسَةِ.","vpn","You (m) went to the school."],["ذَهَبْتِ إِلَى الْمَدْرَسَةِ.","vpn","You (f) went to the school."]],"legend":[["v","Verb: the ending changes"],["p","Particle"],["n","Noun"]]},{"t":"look","head_en":"Look: we, they (m), they (f)","head_ar":"اُنْظُرْ: نَحْنُ، هُمْ، هُنَّ","mode":"kind","sents":[["ذَهَبْنَا إِلَى الْمَدْرَسَةِ.","vpn","We went to the school."],["ذَهَبُوا إِلَى الْمَدْرَسَةِ.","vpn","They (m) went to the school."],["ذَهَبْنَ إِلَى الْمَدْرَسَةِ.","vpn","They (f) went to the school."]],"legend":[["v","Verb: the ending changes"],["p","Particle"],["n","Noun"]]},{"t":"bullets","head_en":"Notice","head_ar":"اُنْظُرْ وَلَاحِظْ","lines":[["What stays the same in all six verbs?","مَاذَا يَبْقَى كَمَا هُوَ فِي الْأَفْعَالِ السِّتَّةِ؟"],["What changes, and where in the word?","مَاذَا يَتَغَيَّرُ، وَأَيْنَ فِي الْكَلِمَةِ؟"],["Is there a separate word for the doer?","هَلْ تُوجَدُ كَلِمَةٌ مُنْفَصِلَةٌ لِلْفَاعِلِ؟"]]},{"t":"rule","head_en":"One person: I, you (m), you (f)","head_ar":"آخِرُ الْفِعْلِ يَدُلُّ عَلَى الْفَاعِلِ.","cards":[{"title_ar":"ـْتُ","title_en":"I","def_ar":"أَنَا","def_en":"ending for “I”","ex":"كَتَبْتُ","col":"b"},{"title_ar":"ـْتَ","title_en":"you (m)","def_ar":"أَنْتَ","def_en":"ending for “you”, a man","ex":"كَتَبْتَ","col":"g"},{"title_ar":"ـْتِ","title_en":"you (f)","def_ar":"أَنْتِ","def_en":"ending for “you”, a woman","ex":"كَتَبْتِ","col":"m"}]},{"t":"rule","head_en":"Many people: we, you, they","head_ar":"لِلْجَمْعِ نِهَايَاتٌ أُخْرَى.","cards":[{"title_ar":"ـْنَا","title_en":"we","def_ar":"نَحْنُ","def_en":"ending for “we”","ex":"كَتَبْنَا","col":"o"},{"title_ar":"ـْتُمْ","title_en":"you (pl)","def_ar":"أَنْتُمْ","def_en":"ending for “you” (many)","ex":"كَتَبْتُمْ","col":"g"},{"title_ar":"ـُوا","title_en":"they (m)","def_ar":"هُمْ","def_en":"ending for “they” (men)","ex":"كَتَبُوا","col":"b"},{"title_ar":"ـْنَ","title_en":"they (f)","def_ar":"هُنَّ","def_en":"ending for “they” (women)","ex":"كَتَبْنَ","col":"m"}]},{"t":"table","head_en":"The whole table: one person","head_ar":"الْفِعْلُ كَتَبَ","headers":["Pronoun","Verb","Meaning"],"rows":[["هُوَ","كَتَبَ","he wrote"],["هِيَ","كَتَبَتْ","she wrote"],["أَنَا","كَتَبْتُ","I wrote"],["أَنْتَ","كَتَبْتَ","you (m) wrote"],["أَنْتِ","كَتَبْتِ","you (f) wrote"]],"cols":["y","o","x"],"note":"The pronoun is hidden inside the verb.","note_ar":"الضَّمِيرُ مُخْتَبِئٌ فِي الْفِعْلِ."},{"t":"table","head_en":"The whole table: many people","head_ar":"الْفِعْلُ كَتَبَ","headers":["Pronoun","Verb","Meaning"],"rows":[["نَحْنُ","كَتَبْنَا","we wrote"],["أَنْتُمْ","كَتَبْتُمْ","you (pl) wrote"],["هُمْ","كَتَبُوا","they (m) wrote"],["هُنَّ","كَتَبْنَ","they (f) wrote"]],"cols":["y","o","x"],"note":"Two people have their own endings. You will meet them later.","note_ar":"لِلِاثْنَيْنِ نِهَايَاتٌ خَاصَّةٌ. سَتَرَاهَا فِيمَا بَعْدُ."},{"t":"pairs","head_en":"You (m) or you (f)?","head_ar":"أَنْتَ أَمْ أَنْتِ؟","la":"You (m)","lb":"You (f)","ca":"b","cb":"m","rows":[["ذَهَبْتَ","you went","ذَهَبْتِ","you went"],["جَلَسْتَ","you sat","جَلَسْتِ","you sat"],["حَضَرْتَ","you came","حَضَرْتِ","you came"]],"tip":"Only the last vowel differs: fatha (man) or kasra (woman).","tip_ar":"الْحَرَكَةُ الْأَخِيرَةُ فَقَطْ تَخْتَلِفُ: فَتْحَةٌ لِلرَّجُلِ وَكَسْرَةٌ لِلْمَرْأَةِ."},{"t":"look","head_en":"Look: asking you, answering I","head_ar":"اُنْظُرْ: سُؤَالٌ وَجَوَابٌ","mode":"kind","sents":[["هَلْ حَضَرْتَ إِلَى الْمَسْجِدِ؟","pvpn","Did you (m) come to the mosque?"],["نَعَمْ، حَضَرْتُ إِلَى الْمَسْجِدِ.","pvpn","Yes, I came to the mosque."],["هَلْ جَلَسْتِ فِي الْمَجْلِسِ؟","pvpn","Did you (f) sit in the majlis?"],["لَا، جَلَسْتُ فِي الْغُرْفَةِ.","pvpn","No, I sat in the room."]],"legend":[["p","Question word / yes / no"],["v","Verb"],["n","Noun"]]},{"t":"say","head_en":"Say it","head_ar":"قُلْ","big_en":"We left the mosque.","big_ar":"خَرَجْنَا مِنَ الْمَسْجِدِ.","small":"The last letters of the verb say “we”: no other word is needed.","small_ar":"آخِرُ الْفِعْلِ يَقُولُ «نَحْنُ»: لَا نَحْتَاجُ إِلَى كَلِمَةٍ أُخْرَى."},{"t":"quiz","head_en":"Try: who did it?","kinds":"vvvvvvvv","items":[["كَتَبْتُ","I wrote"],["ذَهَبْنَا","we went"],["جَلَسْتِ","you (f) sat"],["دَخَلُوا","they (m) entered"],["خَرَجْنَ","they (f) left"],["فَهِمْتَ","you (m) understood"],["رَجَعْتُمْ","you (pl) returned"],["خَدَمْتُ","I served"]]},{"t":"mistake","wrong":"كَتَبْتُ","why_ar":"طَالِبَةٌ تَقُولُ: «كَتَبْتُ تَعْنِي you wrote». خَطَأٌ! التَّاءُ الْمَضْمُومَةُ تَعْنِي أَنَا. أَنْتَ: كَتَبْتَ. أَنْتِ: كَتَبْتِ.","why":"A student says: “كَتَبْتُ means you wrote.” Wrong! The ending ـتُ (ت with damma) means I. You (m) wrote: كَتَبْتَ. You (f) wrote: كَتَبْتِ."}],"can":["I can say who did it from the ending of a past verb.","I can tell I, you (m), you (f), we and they apart."],"can_ar":["أَسْتَطِيعُ أَنْ أَقُولَ مَنْ فَعَلَ مِنْ آخِرِ الْفِعْلِ الْمَاضِي.","أَسْتَطِيعُ أَنْ أُفَرِّقَ بَيْنَ أَنَا وَأَنْتَ وَأَنْتِ وَنَحْنُ وَهُمْ."],"covers":"Lesson 19: the past verb, all persons  ·  includes Lessons 1–18","covers_ar":"الدَّرْسُ التَّاسِعَ عَشَرَ: الْفِعْلُ الْمَاضِي مَعَ كُلِّ الضَّمَائِرِ · مَعَ الدُّرُوسِ ١–١٨","words":[],"sections":[{"name":"A","kind":"passage","role":"comp","en":"Read the questions and answers, then answer.","ins":"اِقْرَأِ النَّصَّ ثُمَّ أَجِبْ.","lines":[["هَلْ ذَهَبْتَ إِلَى الْمَسْجِدِ؟","","“Did you (m) go to the mosque?”"],["نَعَمْ، ذَهَبْتُ إِلَى الْمَسْجِدِ.","","“Yes, I went to the mosque.”"],["هَلْ جَلَسْتَ فِي الْمَجْلِسِ؟","","“Did you (m) sit in the majlis?”"],["نَعَمْ، جَلَسْنَا فِي الْمَجْلِسِ.","","“Yes, we sat in the majlis.”"],["هَلْ خَدَمْتُمْ فِي الْمَسْجِدِ؟","","“Did you (pl) serve in the mosque?”"],["نَعَمْ، خَدَمْنَا فِي الْمَسْجِدِ.","","“Yes, we served in the mosque.”"],["هَلْ رَجَعْتِ إِلَى الْبَيْتِ؟","","“Did you (f) return to the house?”"],["لَا، حَضَرْتُ إِلَى الْحَلْقَةِ.","","“No, I came to the study circle.”"]],"review":false,"items":[{"ar":null,"en":"Is the person asked in line 1 a man or a woman? How do you know?","ar_q":"هَلِ الْمُخَاطَبُ فِي السَّطْرِ الْأَوَّلِ رَجُلٌ أَمِ امْرَأَةٌ؟ كَيْفَ عَرَفْتَ؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["حَضَرْتُ","“we”","to the mosque","A man: the ending ـتَ"],"answer":"A man: the ending ـتَ","model":"A man: the ending ـتَ (fatha).","note":"fatha","id":"d67bcfd6"},{"ar":null,"en":"Where did the speaker go?","ar_q":"إِلَى أَيْنَ ذَهَبَ الْمُتَكَلِّمُ؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["to the mosque","“we”","in the majlis","No: she says she came to the study circle."],"answer":"to the mosque","model":"to the mosque","note":null,"id":"c0726b5a"},{"ar":null,"en":"Where did “we” sit?","ar_q":"أَيْنَ جَلَسْنَا؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["in the majlis","No: she says she came to the study circle.","“we”","to the mosque"],"answer":"in the majlis","model":"in the majlis","note":null,"id":"d8980455"},{"ar":null,"en":"Who served in the mosque?","ar_q":"مَنْ خَدَمَ فِي الْمَسْجِدِ؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["“we”","No: she says she came to the study circle.","in the majlis","to the mosque"],"answer":"“we”","model":"“we” (خَدَمْنَا)","note":"خَدَمْنَا